# Normalise line endings on commit and check out LF everywhere.
#
# The service is edited on Windows and runs on Linux. Without this, CRLF creeps
# into the repository and breaks things in ways that are tedious to diagnose:
# systemd unit files fail to parse, shebangs stop working, and shell scripts
# report "bad interpreter".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
